{"at": "2026-10-30T05:30:45.326340+00:00", "event_id": "01M65MM06E5CBPTMFF83NG2TKX", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M65MKX2FG5E5SAM9D57BX2AE", "final_answer": "A domain PackDocument with the markdown model shape (frontmatter, title, preamble, sections) plus an infra mapper to and from MarkdownDocument, as #194 did for Guide/GuideMarkdown", "mission_id": "01M65MBWAE8VZM6W97DTHDKMQT", "mission_slug": "pack-document-round-trip-01M65MBW", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": "ADR-0006 and HexagonalArchitectureTest keep packs.domain free of infra; #194 set the precedent (Guide + GuideMarkdown). The value keeps the markdown model's shape, so nothing of the form is rebuilt: parsing, canonical writing and comparison stay MarkdownCodec's (ADR-0042 d8, DM-01M60HM8).", "recorded_at": "2026-10-30T05:30:45.326340Z", "resolved_by": "claude", "run_id": "01M65MKX2FG5E5SAM9D57BX2AE", "state_entered_at": "2026-10-30T05:30:45.323678Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
{"at": "2026-10-30T05:30:46.918885+00:00", "event_id": "01M65MM1R6S8XDJJK698Y8160M", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M65MKYMAAQE6RQZEY361SBTP", "final_answer": "Map.equals on the loaded YAML values (ADR-0040 as built); absent and empty frontmatter stay different models, numbers compare as loaded", "mission_id": "01M65MBWAE8VZM6W97DTHDKMQT", "mission_slug": "pack-document-round-trip-01M65MBW", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": "The gate compares a source and a written pack.md read by the same reader, and the canonical writer emits the loaded values, so Map.equals on loaded values is exactly ADR-0036 meaning for a round trip; no numeric or empty-vs-absent drift can arise from our own write. The built-in pack.md has no frontmatter. ADR-0040 is amended to record the ruling; logged as an open review item for the operator.", "recorded_at": "2026-10-30T05:30:46.918885Z", "resolved_by": "claude", "run_id": "01M65MKYMAAQE6RQZEY361SBTP", "state_entered_at": "2026-10-30T05:30:46.916619Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
